  "scope": "Prompt action completion and persistent selected standing height, with measured stability verification retained separately.",
  "confirmed_bug": "stand.py advanced keyboard height only in idle; landing recovery remained active for several seconds and froze the captured launch height. An E press/release wholly inside that interval was discarded.",
