    "height": "Keyboard standing target updates every control step. Launch trajectory temporarily overrides it through crouch/hold/push/flight; first touchdown uses the latest height command. Landing/recovery verification cannot overwrite that selected height.",
    "verification": "Keep the original 1.2 s strict stable check and original quality thresholds; continue observing the attempt while mode is idle. Emit jump_finished only for verification, presented as stability verified in the GUI.",
    "interruption": "Another manual jump may still interrupt pending verification; retain the prior failed/unverified recovery evidence.",
    "manual_jump_gates": "No stationary, acceleration, turning or posture admission gate was reintroduced."
